[
  {
    "beat_id": 1,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "the handwriting on the sticky note fades by one stroke",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "sticky note",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念在整理墙上的便签。\n她已经很久没动过这些便签了。有些纸张发黄，有些边角卷起来，有些字迹淡得几乎看不见。但每一张都有外婆的手温。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 2,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "grandmother",
    "action_visual": "grandmother wipes the sticky note",
    "spoken_dialogue": "小念，美式要九十二度，不多不少。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "grandmother",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "sticky note",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "她把便签一张一张揭下来，用湿布擦墙，再贴回去。动作很慢，像是在做一件仪式。\n第十七张便签——外婆写的：\"小念，美式要九十二度，不多不少。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 3,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian wipes",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念擦了擦墙。墙皮有点潮，昨晚的雨渗进来了。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 4,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian hand pauses mid-motion",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "小念，有些味道，不是用舌头记住的。是用心。你忘了的东西，都在咖啡里。",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "sticky note",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "她把便签贴回去。手指在纸面上停了一下。\n这张便签的背面——有字。\n她翻过来。\n*\"小念，有些味道，不是用舌头记住的。是用心。你忘了的东西，都在咖啡里。\"*"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 5,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian stares intently",
    "spoken_dialogue": "都在咖啡里",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "handwriting",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念盯着那行字。外婆的字迹，圆润的，每个字都像在笑。\n\"都在咖啡里\"。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 6,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian grinds coffee beans, the grinder humming",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "她走到吧台后面，拿起一包咖啡豆。是外婆留下的老配方——中深烘焙的哥伦比亚豆，带着一点焦糖的尾调。\n她开始磨豆。手摇磨豆机转了三圈，豆子碎了，空气里弥漫着焦糖和坚"
  },
