    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "the handwriting on the sticky note fades by one stroke",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "sticky note",
    "emotion": "Mystery",
    "source_text": "墙上的便签——全部在。一张都没少。但每一张便签上的字，都淡了一个笔画。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 17,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "grandmother",
    "action_visual": "grandmother picks up",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "她走到吧台后面，拿起外婆的笔记本——那本记满了配方的旧本子。她翻开第一页。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 18,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian draws latte art in the foam",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "小念，你第一次拉花的时候才五岁。奶泡洒了一桌子，你哭了。我告诉你——拉花不是技术，是心意。",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Sadness",
    "source_text": "*\"小念，你第一次拉花的时候才五岁。奶泡洒了一桌子，你哭了。我告诉你——拉花不是技术，是心意。\"*"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 19,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian pours water into a cup",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "cup wall",
    "emotion": "Sadness",
    "source_text": "苏念的手指在字迹上停了三秒。\n她不记得五岁的自己哭过。但她记得——手指碰到杯壁时的温度，奶泡从拉花缸里倒出来时的声音，外婆的手握着她的手，带着她在咖啡表面画了一"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 20,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian grinds coffee beans, the grinder humming",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念合上笔记本。她走到镜子前。\n镜子里的那个人——圆脸，齐肩短发，围裙。\n她不认识这张脸。但她认识这双手。\n这双手会磨豆。会压粉。会拉花。会冲一杯九十二度的美式"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 21,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian turns around",
    "spoken_dialogue": "休息中",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念转身，走到门口。她把\"休息中\"的牌子翻过来。背面是\"营业中\"。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 22,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian gazes at the door",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "她把门打开。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 23,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian gazes at the coffee cup",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "sticky note",
    "emotion": "Mystery",
    "source_text": "阳光从巷子里涌进来，照在吧台上，照在墙上的便签上，照在那杯没喝的咖啡上。\n咖啡的热气在阳光里升起来，形成一道模糊的白线。\n苏念看着那道白线。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 24,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian furrows brow, pressing fingers to temples",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "sticky note",
    "emotion": "Mystery",
    "source_text": "她知道——明天，她可能不记得今天做了什么。便签上的字可能会再淡一个笔画。墙上的照片可能会再模糊一点。\n但她会记得怎么冲咖啡。\n因为这不在脑子里。在手里。"
  }
]